         <widget class="QLabel" name="online_note">
          <property name="text">
           <string>Online play only contacts this server, never Nintendo's. Its certificate lets games trust it; a game reads it when it starts. Each server gives you a friend code of your own, which new emulator versions keep; back it up to move it to another PC. Adding a friend's code sends them a friend request; once they accept it, you see each other's rooms. In a game, other players can see your IP address, as on a console.</string>
